# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# VulnChain keys. Copy to .env to use; NOTHING is required (public RPC works).
# Keys are NEVER written to data/*.json / VULNCHAIN_REPORT.md — the URL is
# redacted before it reaches meta.rpc. Do not commit your real .env.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# (1) RPC key PER CHAIN — highest priority. Network name uppercased,
#     non-alphanumerics -> underscore. Any chain you want:
# RPC_URL_ETHEREUM=https://eth-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/<ALCHEMY_KEY>
# RPC_URL_BASE=https://base-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/<ALCHEMY_KEY>
# RPC_URL_ARBITRUM=https://arb-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/<ALCHEMY_KEY>
# RPC_URL_BINANCE=https://bnb-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/<ALCHEMY_KEY>
# RPC_URL_POLYGON=https://polygon-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/<ALCHEMY_KEY>
# RPC_URL_MYCHAIN=https://rpc.mychain.example/<MY_KEY>
# RPC_URL=https://...                      # generic fallback for any network

# (1b) Or just give the provider key; the endpoint is built per chain:
# ALCHEMY_API_KEY=
# INFURA_PROJECT_ID=

# (2) ETHERSCAN / explorer key — used by the REAL ContractVerifier to fetch
#     verified Solidity source. One Etherscan V2 key covers many chains;
#     chainid is selected automatically from --network.
# ETHERSCAN_API_KEY=
# ETHERSCAN_API_KEY_BASE=                 # optional per-chain override
# DEFAULT_ETHERSCAN_KEYS=key1,key2       # legacy upstream name, first wins
# EXPLORER_API_URL=https://api.etherscan.io/v2/api
# EXPLORER_API_URL_MYCHAIN=https://explorer.mychain.example/api

# (3) CUSTOM CHAIN — two ways.
#   a) env pair (no JSON):
# CHAIN_ID_MYCHAIN=12345
# RPC_URL_MYCHAIN=https://rpc.mychain.example/<KEY>
#   b) full definition, also allows a custom explorer:
# VULNCHAIN_CHAINS={"mychain":{"chainId":12345,"rpcUrls":["https://rpc.mychain.example/<KEY>"],"explorerApi":"https://explorer.mychain.example/api"}}

# (4) Backend của BugChainIndexer gốc (server/backend + scanners/cron),
#     KHÔNG ảnh hưởng tới src/cli.js. Xem SETUP.md.
# PGHOST=localhost
# PGPORT=5432
# PGDATABASE=bugchain_indexer
# PGUSER=postgres
# PGPASSWORD=
